create an html page which allows users to create multiple json request. each request has following fields - file extension (dropdown with values - xls,xlsx,csv,pdf), user_id (always set to 1), request_id (random integer between 1 to 100, should be different for each request), account_id (dropdown with values 1-20), file (allows user to upload a file and internally converts it to base64 encoded string). On button click, list of requests must be sent as post request to any backend server